WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit comfortably cross-legged or in a chair.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rest both hands on the lower belly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Close the eyes if you like.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe slowly into your hands.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Open the eyes softly to finish.
